{"id":"f9011be22ddebf75","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing.md","title":"超免疫度内存在 Schnorr packing 维数一集合","display":"thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing — 超免疫度内存在 Schnorr packing 维数一集合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing","aliases":["43-thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing"],"display":"thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing — 超免疫度内存在 Schnorr packing 维数一集合","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 17.10.5","source_printed_pages":"543–544","source_pdf_pages":"563–564","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hyperimmune-schnorr-packing — 超免疫度内存在 Schnorr packing 维数一集合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 17.10.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"543–544"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"563–564"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\)</span> 指 B 的度计算不可支配函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SP}\">\\(\\dim_{SP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6cfc6a383edf25e5\" href=\"?note=6cfc6a383edf25e5\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-dimensions\">43-df-schnorr-dimensions</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(A\\equiv_TB\\land\\dim_{SP}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(A\\equiv_TB\\land\\dim_{SP}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\right)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\equiv_TB\\land\\dim_{SP}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\right)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\equiv_TB\\land\\dim_{SP}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项的超免疫是度性质，不能替换为某个特定集合的稀疏性谓词 HyperimmuneSet。与上一原子合用可见，同一个 c.e. 集的 Schnorr Hausdorff 维数为零而 packing 维数可达一。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 17.10.5，印刷页 543–544，PDF 页 563–564。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-dimensions","status":"resolved","id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)$ 指 B 的度计算不可支配函数，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]；$\\equiv_T$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\dim_{SP}$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)$ 指 B 的度计算不可支配函数，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]；$\\equiv_T$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\dim_{SP}$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-schnorr-dimensions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd